<header><p class="enc-kicker">Institution</p><h1 class="enc-title">Army of Northern Virginia</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1861">1861</a>–<a href="/years/1865">1865</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Army of Northern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/virginia">Virginia</a> was the main Confederate army in the eastern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/theatre">theatre</a> of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/american-civil-war">American Civil War</a>. Commanded by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/robert-e-lee">Robert E. Lee</a> from June 1862, it won victories at the Second Battle of Bull Run, Fredericksburg and Chancellorsville but failed in invasions of the North at Antietam and Gettysburg. It surrendered at Appomattox in April 1865.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/army-of-northern-virginia.jpg" alt="Army of Northern Virginia" width="320" height="320" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Marcus365 · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Battle_flag_of_the_Confederate_States_of_America_(With_White_Border).svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
